  "description": "Test helpers for ConventionMapper and ConventionMapper.SourceGenerator mappings: MapperAssert.WritesExactly checks exactly which destination members a map writes, WritesFrom checks each value comes from the right source member (using the generated lineage), AllMappersMatchWriteSets gives every generated map a baseline test, RoundTrips checks map/reverse-map pairs with randomized inputs, AllMethodsCovered / AllMethodsUsed find untested and unused maps, SampleData.Builder builds test objects fluently, and GeneratedCodeMatches snapshots generated code per mapper. Works with any test framework.",
